WEBVTT

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:01.176
"In times of dread,

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:04.120
artists must never choose
to remain silent.

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:07.336
There is no time for self-pity.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:14.120
(Applause)

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:18.216
There is no time for self-pity.

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:19.840
And no room for fear."

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:22.656
And I have made my choice.

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:24.580
And I am always choosing.

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:26.576
Thank you.

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:33.080
(Applause)